# Frontend Redesign Walkthrough — Gestion

## Summary

Transformed the Gestion school management platform from a basic glass-card UI into a modern 2025 SaaS dashboard. All changes are **presentation-layer only** — no logic, API, route, or store modifications.

## What Was Done

### Foundation
- Installed **PrimeVue v4** with Aura preset + PrimeIcons
- Created a complete **CSS design system** with custom properties for colors, radii, shadows, and dark mode
- Added **Inter** font from Google Fonts
- Updated [main.css](file:///c:/work/New_Node_End/frontend/main.css) with globally available utility classes (`.glass-card`, `.role-badge`, `.status-badge`, `.avatar-initials`, `.action-btn`)

### Layout Shell (New)
- **[Sidebar.vue](file:///c:/work/New_Node_End/frontend/src/components/layout/Sidebar.vue)** — Collapsible sidebar with role-aware navigation, PrimeIcons, active route indicator, user avatar + role badge footer
- **[TopBar.vue](file:///c:/work/New_Node_End/frontend/src/components/layout/TopBar.vue)** — Sticky top bar with sidebar toggle, dark/light mode switcher (moon/sun icons), user section
- **[MainLayout.vue](file:///c:/work/New_Node_End/frontend/src/components/layout/MainLayout.vue)** — Composing sidebar + topbar + content slot, replacing the old [Navbar.vue](file:///c:/work/New_Node_End/frontend/src/components/common/Navbar.vue)
- **[App.vue](file:///c:/work/New_Node_End/frontend/src/App.vue)** — Updated to use `MainLayout` for authenticated routes; auth pages render without layout

### Shared Components
| Component | What's New |
|-----------|-----------|
| [StatCard.vue](file:///c:/work/New_Node_End/frontend/src/components/common/StatCard.vue) | Icon + label + value + colored accent bar |
| [PageHeader.vue](file:///c:/work/New_Node_End/frontend/src/components/common/PageHeader.vue) | Title + subtitle + actions slot |
| [EmptyState.vue](file:///c:/work/New_Node_End/frontend/src/components/common/EmptyState.vue) | Centered icon + title + message |
| [FormField.vue](file:///c:/work/New_Node_End/frontend/src/components/common/FormField.vue) | Styled labels, focus rings, required asterisks, dark mode |
| [Table.vue](file:///c:/work/New_Node_End/frontend/src/components/common/Table.vue) | Global search, skeleton loading, empty state, row hover |

### Page Redesigns

| Page | Key Changes |
|------|------------|
| **Login** | Animated splash → two-panel card (gradient brand panel + form), password toggle, gradient submit button, animated background blobs |
| **ForgotPassword** | Stepper progress (step 1), gradient blobs, centered card, styled input |
| **ResetPassword** | Stepper progress (step 2 active, step 1 completed), code + password fields with toggles |
| **Dashboard** | Gradient welcome banner, StatCards per role, recent users table with avatar initials + role badges, student course cards |
| **Departments** | PageHeader + create button, animated form panel, styled Table with icon action buttons, course count badges |
| **Courses** | Department Tag badges, student count badges, multi-select for student assignment |
| **Users** | Avatar initials, role badges (color-coded), status badges (active/inactive), styled confirm/assign dialogs with backdrop blur |
| **Hours** | Two-column layout (form card + entries table), styled selects and date inputs |
| **StudentHours** | Gradient hero stat card, brand-colored bar/pie charts, filter row, course summary cards with progress bars, PDF export |

